  << /ActualText (In 2023\054 Jason Naidoo\054 an avid gamer\054 established Next Level Gaming \046 Esports Arena after noticing that many gamers lacked access to high\055performance equipment and organised events\056 This inspired the creation of a modern entertainment venue where gamers of all ages can play\054 build\054 and perfect their craft\056)
